{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4th B.D.特別企画 過去の遺恨は全て精算！クイズ王のリベンジを返り討ちにしよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地下アイドルリベンジ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ならず..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 真夏の全国ツアー2015＠明治神宮野球場（2015年8月31日）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てたけどべマーズとか懐かしかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして感動的でしたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラストなんか泣きそうになった(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日\n中田はスタジオから始まりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は髪形ストレートになりました\n昨日は巻き巻きでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝はたくさん\nスタジオトーク出させてもらったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齋藤飛鳥のラジオ体操"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日と同じやつだけど\nちゃんと体操しましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PCの前でずっと座ってる人は\n体をちゃんと動かしましょー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4th Anniversary ガチバトル　THE歌王！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フレンチ・キスさんの『If』を\n歌わせてもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケとか\nソロで1曲とか\nめちゃくちゃレアですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またもやトップバッター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張した..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータリング中継"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝ごはんに\nみんなが買ってきてくれたお土産食べたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北から南まで\nいろんなお土産を一気に食べる機会なんて\n幸せですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなありがと～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ声リレー\nあと少しですがご協力よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは\nまたブログ書くよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/2020483/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/